<blockquote class="uncited"><div>I've never experienced this, but I would suspect Talker Alias. Try turn it off and On and see if it help?</div></blockquote>I found out on WPSD Discord this is how to turn off having the Hotspot transmit Talker Alias - I will test this out.<br><br>Under "General DMR Settings" in WPSD Configuration:<br><br>Set "DMR EmbeddedLCOnly: Enabled"<br>Also set "DMR DumpTAData: Disabled"<br><br>Description of settings:<br><blockquote class="uncited"><div>DMR EmbeddedLCOnly: Turn ON to disable extended message support, including GPS and Talker Alias data. This can help reduce problems with some DMR Radios that do not support such features.<br><br>DMR DumpTAData: Turn ON to dump GPS and Talker Alias data to MMDVMHost log file. </div></blockquote><p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=4778">KB8YKF</a> — Mon Feb 24, 2025 10:27 pm</p><hr />
]]></content>
